# Occlusion culling after a teleport: four spots of own-mesh-relief where props went missing from frames on the Mac
# (Hi-Z mips 5-6 built from stale texels, fixed 2026-10-21). Three shots per hold, 1 s, 2.5 s and 4 s after the cut:
# all twelve are the same in every run, the bookshelf, the bench, the lamp post and rope coils, the cupboard in them.
# Run it twice and compare the PNGs; see reports/engine/2026-10-21-hiz-culling.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view nopfx
cam lift off
# table
goto pos 3924 -2073 -6663
clear 3000
cam look 2000
cam cut
cam world 400 2190 270
wait 34
cam hold
wait 1000
shot table_1000
wait 300
wait 1200
shot table_2500
wait 300
wait 1200
shot table_4000
wait 300
# bench
goto pos 2982 -2121 -5631
clear 3000
cam look 2030
cam cut
cam world 330 2180 145
wait 34
cam hold
wait 1000
shot bench_1000
wait 300
wait 1200
shot bench_2500
wait 300
wait 1200
shot bench_4000
wait 300
# cart
goto pos 8545 -1673 5521
clear 3000
cam look 2030
cam cut
cam world 230 2130 100
wait 34
cam hold
wait 1000
shot cart_1000
wait 300
wait 1200
shot cart_2500
wait 300
wait 1200
shot cart_4000
wait 300
# cupboard
goto pos 8502 -1606 -3156
clear 3000
cam look 1938
cam cut
cam world 260 1980 210
wait 34
